#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:7
msgid "🔬 Scientific & Geophysical Research"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:9
msgid "1. Integration of Geophysics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:10
msgid "The plugin is prepared for future integration of deep geophysical data:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Potential (SP)**: Projections use normalized dot product for section "
"alignment and absolute elevation calculation ($Z_{collar} - Depth$)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:12
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**VES (SEV)**: Resistivity models are visualized as blocks on a "
"logarithmic scale ($\\log_{10}(Rho)$) using thickness-to-elevation "
"conversion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:14
msgid "2. Drillhole Modeling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:15
msgid ""
"**Desurveying**: Trayectories are calculated using the **Average Angle "
"Method** (Tangential tracking)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:16
msgid ""
"**Projection**: 3D trajectories are mapped to the 2D plane by calculating"
" distance along the section line while preserving absolute Z."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:18
msgid "3. Core Algorithms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:19
msgid ""
"**Distance & Sampling**: We use `QgsDistanceArea.measureLine()` and "
"direct `dataProvider()` access for DEM sampling, yielding a ~30% "
"performance boost over high-level processing algorithms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/TECHNICAL_COMPENDIUM.md:20
msgid ""
"**Adaptive LOD**: Uses the **Douglas-Peucker (RDP)** algorithm for line "
"simplification and a curvature-based hysteresis logic to adjust sampling "
"density dynamically during zoom."
msgstr ""

